cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "catchment-simulation: sensitivity sweeps of SWMM subcatchment features"
abstract: >-
  A Python package that runs an EPA SWMM model repeatedly, each time with one
  feature of one subcatchment set to a different value, and collects that
  subcatchment's runoff statistics or hydrographs for sensitivity analysis.
authors:
  - given-names: "Rafał"
    family-names: "Buczyński"
    email: rafal.buczynski@sd.pb.edu.pl
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/BuczynskiRafal/catchments_simulation"
url: "https://catchments-simulation.readthedocs.io"
keywords:
  - SWMM
  - hydrology
  - stormwater
  - catchment
  - subcatchment
  - sensitivity analysis
  - simulation
